{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1489342-what-are-everyone-favorite-seasonal-courts","id":1489342,"title":"What are everyone favorite Seasonal Courts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-06T09:25:56-07:00","id":1489342,"title":"What are everyone favorite Seasonal Courts?","content":"I have a strong like for the Spring &amp; Winter courts as I feel a greater affinity for them then the Summer and Autumn Courts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-06T11:10:52-07:00","id":1489353,"title":"","content":"Spring. I don\u2019t like being angry, sorrowful, or afraid. I want to be happy. Ergo, we\u2019re i changeling in the CoD, I\u2019d gravitate to the Spring Court.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-06T13:52:33-07:00","id":1489362,"title":"","content":"Autumn, largely for the weather, the inquisitive focus, and the pragmatic take on what fear entails. It's definitely a group I'd enjoy keeping up with from a safe distance, because I know what magic can get like in this setting, but the default pace of developing events feels easier to keep up with compared to the spy games Winter runs, the politicking Spring deals with, and the constant vigilance and saber-rattling archetypical to Summer. Attending to rituals with citywide stakes might leave a scar or two, but being able to otherwise keep to your own devices feels more plausible with Autumn than the rest.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demigod Beast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1489342-what-are-everyone-favorite-seasonal-courts?p=1489353#post1489353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spring. I don\u2019t like being angry, sorrowful, or afraid.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you enjoy being hungry? Because that's the valid comparison if you're going by just the emotion the court feeds on best instead of how it deals with it. Winter is the introductory court for a significant fraction of changelings joining Seasonal freeholds because when you're freshly escaped from a godlike abuser it feels safest to hide from the things that took your life away from you, not because new changelings love to experience regret.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-06T14:37:05-07:00","id":1489367,"title":"","content":"If we define \u2018favorite\u2019 as \u2018likely to join and function reasonably in\u2019, Autumn or Summer, as an occult geek who half-willingly has had an experience with military drill. Winter sounds good too though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-06T20:49:04-07:00","id":1489387,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1489342-what-are-everyone-favorite-seasonal-courts?p=1489367#post1489367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If we define \u2018favorite\u2019 as \u2018likely to join and function reasonably in\u2019, Autumn or Summer, as an occult geek who half-willingly has had an experience with military drill. Winter sounds good too though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd take any <i>except</i> Summer, honestly. Didn't care much for my time in the military.<br /> <br /> Spring might be nice, although my love of logistics works better in the Trader Courts","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-06T21:50:19-07:00","id":1489390,"title":"","content":"I kinda wish Spring's primary emotion would have been Joy instead of Desire. It's a bit wider, and also, I've seen a lot of people treating Spring like the orgy faction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12103-vintervalpen","name":"Vintervalpen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-07T07:17:31-07:00","id":1489411,"title":"","content":"i like all the courts but i do have a special fondness for the Summer Court. Wrath can take many forms, from political activism and social justice to the vicarious zeal associated with organised sports. <br /> <br /> i mean, if you aren't angry ... you aren't paying attention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1996-firefly-night","name":"Firefly Night","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"150"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-09T11:45:48-07:00","id":1489571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vintervalpen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1489342-what-are-everyone-favorite-seasonal-courts?p=1489390#post1489390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kinda wish Spring's primary emotion would have been Joy instead of Desire. It's a bit wider, and also, I've seen a lot of people treating Spring like the orgy faction.</div> </div> </div> </div>I always thought Desire was perfect for the Spring Court as that emotion could cover as much ground as the other emotions and The Lords Of Summer Of Summer Sourcebook from the first edition really fleshed it out more and me really like this court and the Winter one.<br /> <br /> In the words of my Ogre Stonebones character who was a bodyguard for the Spring King of why he joined the Court of Desire.<br /> <br /> &quot;I didn't join the Winter Court as hiding isn't my style and when your nearly 7 feet tall. Blending in is tricky. I'm not subtle enough for the Autumn Court and I don't want to make a world a scarier place. I'm not a wrathful person in general and I didn't fit in with the Summer Court. But I understand desire quite well and I never regretted joining them.&quot; <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-09T12:27:06-07:00","id":1489576,"title":"","content":"...Huh. After thinking on it, I think my favorite's shifted from Autumn over to Spring. I think I vibe more with Desire than Fear, as well as the themes of growth, change, renewal over entropy, preparation, age, than I used to. Also, while too many people are quick to simplify every court, Spring's just a very easy court to imagine dynamics and variations to-I'm the first to point out Summer has sorcerers and Autumn has soldiers, but it's very easy to imagine a wide variety of different and distinct characters that are still discernably Spring.<br /> <br /> I still love my old dust hermits and spellbreakers of Autumn(rest thee well, Noah Pyre), and Summer always has some of my fondness. Winter, I've put in the work to stop disliking it.<br /> <br /> Man, mix this in with the realization my bias shifted from Darklings to Fairest, that's a bit of clear mood change over the years. Elementals still rock that solid second, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-11T11:34:35-07:00","id":1489769,"title":"","content":"All the Seeming are quite good I found and that is why this series is my favorite with Mage The Awakening &amp; Vampire The Masquerade a close second.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}